      "comment": "POLLY GOLD (2) jumped cleanly from the rails to lead much the way when second (20.50) at this track in a T3 RSTW over 350m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Overdue and is among the main hopes. CESSNA TITAN (5) ran well two back when hitting the frame then out of the placings at Ballarat latest but returns to a course where he has performed well. Rates a winning chance on best. CHLOE'S FAULT (1) had been racing well prior to her last start sixth at Warragul following a Maiden win three back with a second placing. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. AWE REALLY (8) solid chance again.",
